\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Join, all ye ransomed Sons Of grace,
\par The holy joy prolong,
\par And shout to the Redeemer's praise
\par A solemn midnight song.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Blessing and thanks and love and might
\par Be to our Jesus given,
\par Who turns our darkness into light,
\par Who turns our hell ot heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thither our faithful souls He leads,
\par Thither He bids us rise,
\par With crowns of joy upon our heads,
\par To meet Him in the skies.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

